[h2]Build 0.9.53[/h2]
[h3]Added[/h3]
[list]
[*][b]Exhaust expansion tank[/b] (2x2, Power tab): a buffer on the exhaust network for short power cuts. While no exhaust port can take the exhaust - its fan has no power, or every damper is shut - burners, garbage compactors and factory machines fill the tank instead of gassing their rooms.
[*]Holds 30,000 toxic gas - about eight hours of a trash gasifier on normal - and drains into the ports over about two hours once one is working again. When it's full, the exhaust backs up as before.
[*]Destroyed or deconstructed, it lets out everything it holds - empty it first.
[/list]
